{"data": [{"id": "2122129997523730742", "author_id": "1439508630", "text": "@theinformation Reminds me of SBF trying to hold up tbe crypto ponzi by bailing out everyone before he blew up himself.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:49:53.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/GSBImagesMBusch/status/2122129997523730742", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 176, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122123676002709715", "author_id": "1720665183188922368", "text": "@podcastcop @theinformation 1. Levels the field for AMD and Broadcom to win deals on chip performance and cost instead of matching Nvidia-scale credit risk.\n2. Cuts circular financing exposure, reducing systemic risk if AI demand softens.\n3. Forces hyperscalers and private capital to fund builds directly,", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:24:46.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122123676002709715", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122123545862144328", "author_id": "1115379388164345856", "text": "@theinformation Someone explain 5 positive outcomes  to me @grok https://t.co/2vKuPsGqjs", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:24:15.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/podcastcop/status/2122123545862144328", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 180, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122118723452407892", "author_id": "1675183361214627840", "text": "@theinformation I’m getting tired of this whole “circular financing” narrative being used to scare investors.\n\nGoogle, Microsoft, Amazon, and NVIDIA have been investing in startups and companies across their ecosystems for years. Why? Because they believe in their technology, their future", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:05:05.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/logicrxt/status/2122118723452407892", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 171, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122108507298415023", "author_id": "512089526", "text": "@theinformation @QTRResearch I’ve heard so much about your honesty and dedication, and I can honestly say your work speaks for itself. Thank you, @lambo_raulG, for making such a positive difference in my life. I don’t need many words to express my gratitude because my experience says it all Raul.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:24:29.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/DavidMoralejo/status/2122108507298415023", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122106928277131631", "author_id": "596913940", "text": "@theinformation If if if if", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:18:13.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/JamesTrvdes/status/2122106928277131631", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1126, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122103583374245909", "author_id": "912164092210638849", "text": "@theinformation @QTRResearch It feels good when an opportunity gives you a reason to appreciate the choice you made. That’s the feeling I have when I look back at my experience with @lambo_raulG. I’m grateful for the progress so far, and now i know why his name keeps coming up in positive conversations.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:04:55.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/MannyTavarez721/status/2122103583374245909", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122102960868188399", "author_id": "14552109", "text": "@theinformation AI infrastructure is being financed with capital, contracts, and a considerable amount of #theJensenPut", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:02: